  "answer_text": "It's currently the **2026 NBA Finals**! The New York Knicks are playing the San Antonio Spurs, with the Knicks holding a 2-0 series lead. Here's where you can get tickets:\n\n---\n\n### \ud83c\udf9f\ufe0f Where to Buy NBA Finals Tickets\n\n1. **Ticketmaster** *(Official Ticketing Partner of the NBA)*\n- NBA tickets for the 2025-2026 season are available to purchase on Ticketmaster, the Official Ticketing Partner of the NBA, where you can browse a wide selection of tickets.\n- Visit: [ticketmaster.com/nba](https://www.ticketmaster.com/nba)\n\n2. **NBA.com**\n- The official NBA schedule, including playoff games, can be found at NBA.com, where you can view all upcoming games and ticket options.\n- Visit: [nba.com/schedule](https://www.nba.com/schedule)\n\n3. **Third-Party Resellers**\n- Sites like **StubHub**, **SeatGeek**, and **Vivid Seats** also offer NBA Finals tickets, though prices may vary.\n- NBATickets.us also offers NBA tickets and VIP packages for current and upcoming games.\n\n---\n\n### \ud83d\udcb0 Ticket Prices\n\n- NBA Finals tickets for 2026 start at $1,009.\n- Ticket prices and availability update frequently, so be sure to check back often.\n- If tickets for a game are sold out, additional seats may become available closer to the game, so keep checking back.\n\n---\n\n### \ud83d\udcc5 Upcoming Games\n\nThe NBA Finals are currently ongoing between the **New York Knicks** and **San Antonio Spurs**. After Game 2 of the 2026 NBA Finals, the Knicks took a 2-0 series lead against the Spurs.\n\nWould you like more specific information about a particular game or team?",
